      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2012 The Authors. Journal of Medical Imaging and Radiation Oncology © 2012 The Royal Australian and New Zealand College of Radiologists.",
        "AbstractText": "The imaging features and histology of two cases of non-neurogenic intraneural malignancy--an epithelioid sarcoma and myeloma--are described. These cases are important reminders that not all nerve tumours are of neural origin and also show the crucial importance of a robust multidisciplinary approach to achieve the correct diagnosis and management."
